          {%- else -%}
            {%- assign f_qq = "How much can I earn per event?|Is it free to join as a backdrop owner?|How do sponsors find my backdrop?|Who provides the ad artwork?|When and how do I get paid?" | split: '|' -%}
            {%- assign f_qa = "<p>Most owners earn between <strong>₹15,000 and ₹40,000 per event</strong> — depending on event size, audience profile, and number of sponsor slots filled.</p>|<p>Yes. Listing is completely free — no contracts, lock-ins, or upfront fees. You only ever earn.</p>|<p>Our algorithm matches you with brands whose target audience aligns with your event guests. Sponsor offers come automatically — you just approve the ones you like.</p>|<p>Sponsors send print-ready artwork for their slot. We handle the rest — design, placement, printing and delivery.</p>|<p>Payment hits your account within <strong>48 hours</strong> of the event — no invoicing, no chasing.</p>" | split: '|' -%}
            {%- for i in (0..4) -%}
